Object.assign(translations.fr,{'Business Day Close':'Clôture de journée','Verify the day, obtain approval, and advance the bank’s business date.':'Vérifiez la journée, obtenez une approbation et avancez la date bancaire.','Close readiness':'Contrôles de clôture','Request day close':'Demander la clôture','Prepare closing storage':'Préparer le stockage de clôture','Closed through':'Clôturé jusqu’au','Closing history':'Historique des clôtures','Closed':'Clôturé','Closing':'Clôture en cours','Closing totals':'Totaux de clôture','Retry close':'Réessayer la clôture','No days closed yet.':'Aucune journée clôturée.','Approved by':'Approuvé par','No pending accounting work or balance differences were found. Readiness is checked again at approval.':'Aucun travail comptable en attente ni écart de solde détecté. Les contrôles seront répétés lors de l’approbation.','Closing requires another administrator’s approval. Journals and ledger changes pause while an approved close completes. Closed days cannot be reopened here.':'La clôture exige l’approbation d’un autre administrateur. Les écritures et modifications de comptes sont suspendues pendant la clôture approuvée. Les journées clôturées ne peuvent pas être rouvertes ici.','Close this business day and advance to the next working day after approval.':'Clôturez cette journée et passez au prochain jour ouvré après approbation.','After ledgers are created, advance the date through Business Day Close. Calendar settings still require approval.':'Après création des comptes, avancez la date via Clôture de journée. Les paramètres du calendrier nécessitent toujours une approbation.','Resolve pending journal, ledger or day-close approvals first.':'Traitez d’abord les approbations d’écritures, de comptes ou de clôture en attente.','Complete pending journal and ledger deliveries first.':'Terminez d’abord les écritures et comptes en attente de traitement.','Ledger balances do not match journal totals. Investigate reconciliation differences before closing.':'Les soldes ne correspondent pas aux écritures. Examinez les écarts avant de clôturer.','Prepare closing storage for this bank first.':'Préparez d’abord le stockage de clôture de cette banque.','An approved day close is in progress. Complete or retry it before changing accounting data.':'Une clôture approuvée est en cours. Terminez-la ou réessayez avant de modifier les données comptables.'});
Object.assign(translations.sw,{'Business Day Close':'Kufunga siku ya benki','Verify the day, obtain approval, and advance the bank’s business date.':'Kagua siku, pata idhini na usogeze tarehe ya benki.','Close readiness':'Utayari wa kufunga','Request day close':'Omba kufunga siku','Prepare closing storage':'Andaa hifadhi ya kufunga','Closed through':'Imefungwa hadi','Closing history':'Historia ya kufunga','Closed':'Imefungwa','Closing':'Inafungwa','Closing totals':'Jumla za kufunga','Retry close':'Jaribu kufunga tena','No days closed yet.':'Hakuna siku iliyofungwa bado.','Approved by':'Imeidhinishwa na','No pending accounting work or balance differences were found. Readiness is checked again at approval.':'Hakuna kazi ya uhasibu inayosubiri wala tofauti za salio. Utayari utakaguliwa tena wakati wa idhini.','Closing requires another administrator’s approval. Journals and ledger changes pause while an approved close completes. Closed days cannot be reopened here.':'Kufunga kunahitaji idhini ya msimamizi mwingine. Miamala na mabadiliko ya akaunti yanasitishwa wakati kufunga kunakamilika. Siku zilizofungwa haziwezi kufunguliwa tena hapa.','Close this business day and advance to the next working day after approval.':'Funga siku hii na usonge hadi siku inayofuata ya kazi baada ya idhini.','After ledgers are created, advance the date through Business Day Close. Calendar settings still require approval.':'Baada ya akaunti kuundwa, sogeza tarehe kupitia Kufunga siku ya benki. Mipangilio ya kalenda bado inahitaji idhini.','Resolve pending journal, ledger or day-close approvals first.':'Shughulikia kwanza idhini za miamala, akaunti au kufunga siku zinazosubiri.','Complete pending journal and ledger deliveries first.':'Kamilisha kwanza miamala na akaunti zinazosubiri kurekodiwa.','Ledger balances do not match journal totals. Investigate reconciliation differences before closing.':'Salio la akaunti halilingani na jumla za miamala. Chunguza tofauti kabla ya kufunga.','Prepare closing storage for this bank first.':'Andaa kwanza hifadhi ya kufunga ya benki hii.','An approved day close is in progress. Complete or retry it before changing accounting data.':'Kufunga siku kulikoidhinishwa kunaendelea. Kamilisha au jaribu tena kabla ya kubadilisha data ya uhasibu.'});

Object.assign(translations.fr,{"Product Factory":"Catalogue de produits","Deposit products":"Produits de dépôt","Define the products your bank will offer to customers.":"Définissez les produits que votre banque proposera à ses clients.","Create product":"Créer un produit","Product type":"Type de produit","Savings":"Épargne","Current account":"Compte courant","Product code":"Code du produit","Product name":"Nom du produit","Product":"Produit","Approved products":"Produits approuvés","Minimum opening":"Dépôt initial minimum","Minimum balance":"Solde minimum","Liability account":"Compte de passif","Revision":"Version","Revisions":"Versions","Product revisions":"Versions du produit","Manage product":"Gérer le produit","No approved products yet.":"Aucun produit approuvé.","The bank must be active to configure products.":"La banque doit être active pour configurer des produits.","Code, type, currency and liability mapping are fixed after approval.":"Le code, le type, la devise et le compte de passif sont fixes après approbation.","Use exact amounts in the product currency. Minimum opening must be at least the minimum balance.":"Utilisez des montants exacts dans la devise du produit. Le dépôt initial minimum doit être au moins égal au solde minimum.","Product definitions prepare for account opening. Customer accounts, interest, fees and overdrafts are not available in this module.":"Les produits préparent l’ouverture de comptes. Les comptes clients, intérêts, frais et découverts ne sont pas disponibles dans ce module.","Enable a currency and approve an active liability posting account with a credit normal balance first.":"Activez une devise et approuvez un compte de passif actif avec un solde normal créditeur."});
Object.assign(translations.sw,{"Product Factory":"Katalogi ya bidhaa","Deposit products":"Bidhaa za amana","Define the products your bank will offer to customers.":"Fafanua bidhaa ambazo benki yako itatoa kwa wateja.","Create product":"Unda bidhaa","Product type":"Aina ya bidhaa","Savings":"Akiba","Current account":"Akaunti ya matumizi","Product code":"Msimbo wa bidhaa","Product name":"Jina la bidhaa","Product":"Bidhaa","Approved products":"Bidhaa zilizoidhinishwa","Minimum opening":"Kiasi cha chini cha kufungua","Minimum balance":"Salio la chini","Liability account":"Akaunti ya madeni","Revision":"Toleo","Revisions":"Matoleo","Product revisions":"Matoleo ya bidhaa","Manage product":"Dhibiti bidhaa","No approved products yet.":"Hakuna bidhaa zilizoidhinishwa bado.","The bank must be active to configure products.":"Benki lazima iwe hai ili kusanidi bidhaa.","Code, type, currency and liability mapping are fixed after approval.":"Msimbo, aina, sarafu na akaunti ya madeni haziwezi kubadilishwa baada ya idhini.","Use exact amounts in the product currency. Minimum opening must be at least the minimum balance.":"Tumia kiasi sahihi katika sarafu ya bidhaa. Kiasi cha kufungua kisipungue salio la chini.","Product definitions prepare for account opening. Customer accounts, interest, fees and overdrafts are not available in this module.":"Ufafanuzi wa bidhaa huandaa kufungua akaunti. Akaunti za wateja, riba, ada na matumizi yanayozidi salio havipatikani katika moduli hii.","Enable a currency and approve an active liability posting account with a credit normal balance first.":"Wezesha sarafu na uidhinishe akaunti hai ya madeni yenye salio la kawaida la krediti kwanza."});

