Object.assign(translations.fr,{"Customers":"Clients","Individual onboarding":"Inscription des particuliers","Register individuals, review identity references and approve customer changes.":"Enregistrez les particuliers, examinez les références d’identité et approuvez les modifications.","Register customer":"Enregistrer un client","Prepare customer storage":"Préparer le stockage clients","Search by name or customer number":"Rechercher par nom ou numéro client","Customer status":"Statut du client","Approved customer records":"Dossiers clients approuvés","Customer":"Client","Delivery":"Application","Applied":"Appliqué","Awaiting delivery":"En attente d’application","Retry delivery":"Réessayer l’application","No approved customers yet.":"Aucun client approuvé.","Prospect":"Prospect","Blocked":"Bloqué","Customer details":"Détails du client","Manage customer":"Gérer le client","Full name":"Nom complet","Date of birth":"Date de naissance","Nationality":"Nationalité","Country of residence":"Pays de résidence","Residential address":"Adresse de résidence","Phone":"Téléphone","Document type":"Type de document","Document issuing country":"Pays émetteur","Document number":"Numéro du document","Document expiry":"Expiration du document","Document reference":"Référence du document","Manual review reference":"Référence de vérification manuelle","Duplicate review explanation":"Explication du doublon","National ID":"Carte d’identité nationale","Passport":"Passeport"});

Object.assign(translations.sw,{"Customers":"Wateja","Individual onboarding":"Usajili wa watu binafsi","Register individuals, review identity references and approve customer changes.":"Sajili watu binafsi, kagua rejea za utambulisho na uidhinishe mabadiliko.","Register customer":"Sajili mteja","Prepare customer storage":"Andaa hifadhi ya wateja","Search by name or customer number":"Tafuta kwa jina au nambari ya mteja","Customer status":"Hali ya mteja","Approved customer records":"Rekodi za wateja zilizoidhinishwa","Customer":"Mteja","Delivery":"Utekelezaji","Applied":"Imetekelezwa","Awaiting delivery":"Inasubiri utekelezaji","Retry delivery":"Jaribu utekelezaji tena","No approved customers yet.":"Hakuna wateja walioidhinishwa bado.","Prospect":"Mteja mtarajiwa","Blocked":"Imezuiwa","Customer details":"Maelezo ya mteja","Manage customer":"Dhibiti mteja","Full name":"Jina kamili","Date of birth":"Tarehe ya kuzaliwa","Nationality":"Uraia","Country of residence":"Nchi ya makazi","Residential address":"Anwani ya makazi","Phone":"Simu","Document type":"Aina ya hati","Document issuing country":"Nchi iliyotoa hati","Document number":"Nambari ya hati","Document expiry":"Mwisho wa uhalali wa hati","Document reference":"Rejea ya hati","Manual review reference":"Rejea ya ukaguzi wa mtu","Duplicate review explanation":"Maelezo ya ukaguzi wa marudio","National ID":"Kitambulisho cha taifa","Passport":"Pasipoti"});

Object.assign(translations.fr,{"Prepare this bank’s customer tables before onboarding.":"Préparez les tables clients de cette banque avant l’inscription.","Changes require another administrator’s approval and successful delivery to the bank database.":"Les modifications nécessitent l’approbation d’un autre administrateur et leur application dans la base de la banque.","Activation records a manual review, not automated identity or sanctions verification. Customer account opening comes next.":"L’activation enregistre une vérification manuelle, sans contrôle automatique d’identité ni de sanctions. L’ouverture de comptes clients viendra ensuite.","Use document references from your approved document repository. Do not enter passwords or upload documents here.":"Utilisez les références de votre dépôt documentaire approuvé. Ne saisissez pas de mots de passe et ne téléversez pas de documents ici.","Active status requires a manual review reference and an unexpired document, where an expiry date applies.":"Le statut Actif exige une référence de vérification manuelle et un document valide lorsqu’une expiration s’applique.","If the name and date of birth match another record, investigate and explain why this is a different person. Matching identity documents cannot be duplicated.":"Si le nom et la date de naissance correspondent à un autre dossier, vérifiez et expliquez pourquoi il s’agit d’une autre personne. Un même document d’identité ne peut pas être dupliqué."});

Object.assign(translations.sw,{"Prepare this bank’s customer tables before onboarding.":"Andaa majedwali ya wateja ya benki hii kabla ya usajili.","Changes require another administrator’s approval and successful delivery to the bank database.":"Mabadiliko yanahitaji idhini ya msimamizi mwingine na utekelezaji katika hifadhidata ya benki.","Activation records a manual review, not automated identity or sanctions verification. Customer account opening comes next.":"Uwezeshaji hurekodi ukaguzi wa mtu, si uthibitishaji wa kiotomatiki wa utambulisho au vikwazo. Kufungua akaunti za wateja kutafuata.","Use document references from your approved document repository. Do not enter passwords or upload documents here.":"Tumia rejea kutoka hifadhi ya hati iliyoidhinishwa. Usiingize nenosiri wala kupakia hati hapa.","Active status requires a manual review reference and an unexpired document, where an expiry date applies.":"Hali Hai inahitaji rejea ya ukaguzi wa mtu na hati halali ikiwa tarehe ya mwisho inatumika.","If the name and date of birth match another record, investigate and explain why this is a different person. Matching identity documents cannot be duplicated.":"Jina na tarehe ya kuzaliwa vikilingana na rekodi nyingine, chunguza na ueleze kwa nini huyu ni mtu tofauti. Hati sawa za utambulisho haziwezi kurudiwa."});

Object.assign(translations.fr,{"Deposit accounts":"Comptes de dépôt","Accounts and deposits":"Comptes et dépôts","Open deposit account":"Ouvrir un compte de dépôt","Prepare account storage":"Préparer le stockage des comptes","Awaiting funding":"En attente de financement","Frozen":"Gelé","Account status":"Statut du compte","Account name":"Nom du compte","Customer number":"Numéro client","Product revision":"Version du produit","Minimum opening amount":"Dépôt initial minimum","Approved account records":"Comptes approuvés","Product / currency":"Produit / devise","Deposit account details":"Détails du compte de dépôt","Manage deposit account":"Gérer le compte de dépôt","Approved product":"Produit approuvé","Opening prerequisites":"Conditions d’ouverture","No approved accounts yet.":"Aucun compte approuvé.","Search by account name, account or customer number":"Rechercher par nom ou numéro de compte ou de client","Open accounts for approved customers and preserve their agreed product terms.":"Ouvrez des comptes pour les clients approuvés et conservez leurs conditions convenues.","Accounts await funding. Deposits, withdrawals and balances are not available in this release.":"Les comptes attendent leur financement. Dépôts, retraits et soldes ne sont pas disponibles dans cette version.","Product terms are fixed at opening. Later product changes do not alter this account.":"Les conditions sont fixées à l’ouverture. Les modifications ultérieures du produit ne changent pas ce compte.","Customer, legal entity, currency and product revision cannot change after opening.":"Le client, l’entité juridique, la devise et la version du produit sont fixes après l’ouverture.","Approve and deliver an active customer, and activate a deposit product before opening an account.":"Approuvez et appliquez un client actif, puis activez un produit de dépôt avant l’ouverture.","Selectors show the first 100 active customers and products.":"Les listes affichent les 100 premiers clients et produits actifs.","Prepare this bank’s account tables before opening accounts.":"Préparez les tables de comptes avant l’ouverture."});
Object.assign(translations.sw,{"Deposit accounts":"Akaunti za amana","Accounts and deposits":"Akaunti na amana","Open deposit account":"Fungua akaunti ya amana","Prepare account storage":"Andaa hifadhi ya akaunti","Awaiting funding":"Inasubiri kuweka fedha","Frozen":"Imesitishwa","Account status":"Hali ya akaunti","Account name":"Jina la akaunti","Customer number":"Nambari ya mteja","Product revision":"Toleo la bidhaa","Minimum opening amount":"Kiasi cha chini cha kufungua","Approved account records":"Akaunti zilizoidhinishwa","Product / currency":"Bidhaa / sarafu","Deposit account details":"Maelezo ya akaunti ya amana","Manage deposit account":"Dhibiti akaunti ya amana","Approved product":"Bidhaa iliyoidhinishwa","Opening prerequisites":"Masharti ya kufungua","No approved accounts yet.":"Hakuna akaunti zilizoidhinishwa bado.","Search by account name, account or customer number":"Tafuta kwa jina au nambari ya akaunti au mteja","Open accounts for approved customers and preserve their agreed product terms.":"Fungua akaunti kwa wateja walioidhinishwa na uhifadhi masharti yao ya bidhaa.","Accounts await funding. Deposits, withdrawals and balances are not available in this release.":"Akaunti zinasubiri fedha. Kuweka, kutoa na salio havipatikani katika toleo hili.","Product terms are fixed at opening. Later product changes do not alter this account.":"Masharti yanawekwa wakati wa kufungua. Mabadiliko ya baadaye ya bidhaa hayabadili akaunti hii.","Customer, legal entity, currency and product revision cannot change after opening.":"Mteja, taasisi ya kisheria, sarafu na toleo la bidhaa haviwezi kubadilika baada ya kufungua.","Approve and deliver an active customer, and activate a deposit product before opening an account.":"Idhinisha na hifadhi mteja hai, kisha washa bidhaa ya amana kabla ya kufungua akaunti.","Selectors show the first 100 active customers and products.":"Orodha zinaonyesha wateja na bidhaa hai 100 za kwanza.","Prepare this bank’s account tables before opening accounts.":"Andaa majedwali ya akaunti kabla ya kufungua akaunti."});

Object.assign(translations.fr,{"Balance and funding":"Solde et financement","Record funding":"Enregistrer un dépôt","Posted customer balance":"Solde client comptabilisé","Liability ledger balance":"Solde du compte de passif","Matched":"Concordant","Reconciliation":"Rapprochement","Awaiting confirmation":"En attente de confirmation","Mismatch — investigate before posting":"Écart — examiner avant comptabilisation","No funding posted yet.":"Aucun dépôt comptabilisé.","Prepare funding storage":"Préparer le stockage des dépôts","Upgrade this bank’s storage before funding accounts.":"Mettez à niveau le stockage avant de financer les comptes.","Funding prerequisites":"Conditions de dépôt","Receiving asset ledger":"Compte d’actif destinataire","Dedicated customer liability ledger":"Compte de passif réservé au client","Receipt reference":"Référence du reçu","Receipt evidence and reason":"Justificatif du reçu et motif","Accounting entries":"Écritures comptables","Record only funds already received and verified. This entry does not initiate a bank transfer.":"Enregistrez uniquement des fonds déjà reçus et vérifiés. Cette écriture ne déclenche pas de virement.","Only posted deposits affect the balance. Withdrawals, holds and funding reversals are not available yet.":"Seuls les dépôts comptabilisés affectent le solde. Retraits, blocages de fonds et annulations ne sont pas encore disponibles.","Use Balance and funding to record received deposits and review posted balances. Withdrawals are not available yet.":"Utilisez Solde et financement pour enregistrer les dépôts reçus et consulter les soldes. Les retraits ne sont pas encore disponibles.","Approve and deliver an asset ledger and a dedicated liability ledger matching this account’s currency, legal entity and product chart mapping.":"Approuvez et appliquez un compte d’actif et un compte de passif dédié correspondant à la devise, l’entité et au produit.","The first deposit binds an unused liability ledger to this customer account. Later deposits use the same ledger. Selectors show the first 100 matching ledgers.":"Le premier dépôt réserve un compte de passif inutilisé à ce client. Les dépôts suivants utilisent ce même compte. Les listes affichent les 100 premiers comptes correspondants."});
Object.assign(translations.sw,{"Balance and funding":"Salio na amana","Record funding":"Rekodi amana","Posted customer balance":"Salio la mteja lililorekodiwa","Liability ledger balance":"Salio la leja ya madeni","Matched":"Zinalingana","Reconciliation":"Ulinganisho","Awaiting confirmation":"Inasubiri uthibitisho","Mismatch — investigate before posting":"Tofauti — chunguza kabla ya kurekodi","No funding posted yet.":"Hakuna amana iliyorekodiwa bado.","Prepare funding storage":"Andaa hifadhi ya amana","Upgrade this bank’s storage before funding accounts.":"Sasisha hifadhi ya benki kabla ya kuweka fedha kwenye akaunti.","Funding prerequisites":"Masharti ya amana","Receiving asset ledger":"Leja ya mali inayopokea fedha","Dedicated customer liability ledger":"Leja ya madeni ya mteja pekee","Receipt reference":"Kumbukumbu ya risiti","Receipt evidence and reason":"Ushahidi wa risiti na sababu","Accounting entries":"Maingizo ya uhasibu","Record only funds already received and verified. This entry does not initiate a bank transfer.":"Rekodi tu fedha zilizopokelewa na kuthibitishwa. Ingizo hili halianzishi uhamisho wa benki.","Only posted deposits affect the balance. Withdrawals, holds and funding reversals are not available yet.":"Amana zilizorekodiwa tu hubadili salio. Kutoa, kuzuia fedha na kubatilisha amana bado havipatikani.","Use Balance and funding to record received deposits and review posted balances. Withdrawals are not available yet.":"Tumia Salio na amana kurekodi fedha zilizopokelewa na kukagua salio. Kutoa fedha bado hakupatikani.","Approve and deliver an asset ledger and a dedicated liability ledger matching this account’s currency, legal entity and product chart mapping.":"Idhinisha na hifadhi leja ya mali na leja maalumu ya madeni inayolingana na sarafu, taasisi na bidhaa ya akaunti.","The first deposit binds an unused liability ledger to this customer account. Later deposits use the same ledger. Selectors show the first 100 matching ledgers.":"Amana ya kwanza huunganisha leja ya madeni ambayo haijatumika na akaunti hii. Amana zinazofuata hutumia leja hiyo. Orodha zinaonyesha leja 100 za kwanza zinazolingana."});

