Object.assign(translations.fr,{"Download PDF":"Télécharger le PDF","Customer alerts":"Alertes clients","Alert preference":"Préférence d’alerte","Alert log":"Journal des alertes","No SMS or email provider is configured.":"Aucun fournisseur SMS ou e-mail n’est configuré.","Alerts are queued and will be sent once a provider is connected.":"Les alertes sont en file d’attente et seront envoyées dès qu’un fournisseur sera connecté.","Created":"Créée","Event":"Événement","Channel":"Canal","Destination":"Destination","Message":"Message","Status":"Statut","Credit":"Crédit","Debit":"Débit","Pending":"En attente","Sent":"Envoyée","Failed":"Échec","All":"Toutes","attempts":"tentatives","Send again":"Renvoyer","No alerts yet.":"Aucune alerte pour l’instant.","Alerts never include balances or full account numbers. Destinations are masked here; changes to where alerts go require independent approval.":"Les alertes n’incluent jamais de solde ni de numéro de compte complet. Les destinations sont masquées ici ; tout changement de destination exige une approbation indépendante.","Onboard a customer first.":"Enregistrez d’abord un client.","No alert preference yet.":"Aucune préférence d’alerte.","Current":"Actuelle","No alerts":"Aucune alerte","Yes":"Oui","No":"Non","Re-enter the full destination; it is verified by the approver. Another administrator must approve before alerts change.":"Saisissez à nouveau la destination complète ; l’approbateur la vérifie. Un autre administrateur doit approuver avant tout changement.","Register a bank first.":"Enregistrez d’abord une banque."});
Object.assign(translations.sw,{"Download PDF":"Pakua PDF","Customer alerts":"Arifa za wateja","Alert preference":"Mapendeleo ya arifa","Alert log":"Kumbukumbu za arifa","No SMS or email provider is configured.":"Hakuna mtoa huduma wa SMS au barua pepe aliyesanidiwa.","Alerts are queued and will be sent once a provider is connected.":"Arifa zimewekwa foleni na zitatumwa mtoa huduma akiunganishwa.","Created":"Iliundwa","Event":"Tukio","Channel":"Njia","Destination":"Mpokeaji","Message":"Ujumbe","Status":"Hali","Credit":"Ingizo","Debit":"Toleo","Pending":"Inasubiri","Sent":"Imetumwa","Failed":"Imeshindwa","All":"Zote","attempts":"majaribio","Send again":"Tuma tena","No alerts yet.":"Bado hakuna arifa.","Alerts never include balances or full account numbers. Destinations are masked here; changes to where alerts go require independent approval.":"Arifa hazijumuishi salio wala namba kamili ya akaunti. Wapokeaji wamefichwa hapa; kubadilisha mpokeaji kunahitaji idhini huru.","Onboard a customer first.":"Sajili mteja kwanza.","No alert preference yet.":"Bado hakuna mapendeleo ya arifa.","Current":"Ya sasa","No alerts":"Hakuna arifa","Yes":"Ndiyo","No":"Hapana","Re-enter the full destination; it is verified by the approver. Another administrator must approve before alerts change.":"Andika tena mpokeaji kamili; mwidhinishaji ataithibitisha. Msimamizi mwingine lazima aidhinishe kabla arifa hazijabadilika.","Register a bank first.":"Sajili benki kwanza."});
