Object.assign(translations.fr,{"Customer type":"Type de client","Individual":"Particulier","Organization":"Organisation","Registration certificate":"Certificat d’immatriculation","For an organization, enter the registered name, the incorporation date as date of birth, the country of registration as nationality, and the registration certificate as the document.":"Pour une organisation, saisissez la raison sociale, la date de constitution comme date de naissance, le pays d’immatriculation comme nationalité et le certificat d’immatriculation comme document.","Directors & owners":"Dirigeants et bénéficiaires","Person":"Personne","Role":"Rôle","Ownership %":"Participation %","None":"Aucun","Director":"Dirigeant","Beneficial owner":"Bénéficiaire effectif","Representative":"Représentant","Record every director and each beneficial owner with their ownership percentage. At least one director is required before the organization can transact. Ownership applies to beneficial owners only.":"Enregistrez chaque dirigeant et chaque bénéficiaire effectif avec sa participation. Au moins un dirigeant est requis avant toute opération. La participation ne concerne que les bénéficiaires effectifs.","Mandate":"Mandat","Account mandate":"Mandat du compte","Signing rule":"Règle de signature","Any one signer":"Un signataire","Any two signers":"Deux signataires","All signers":"Tous les signataires","Joint holder":"Cotitulaire","Authorised signatory":"Signataire autorisé","Guardian":"Tuteur","Holder":"Titulaire","Current rule":"Règle actuelle","No mandate recorded yet.":"Aucun mandat enregistré.","Signatories must be recorded directors or representatives of the organization.":"Les signataires doivent être des dirigeants ou représentants enregistrés de l’organisation.","The account holder is a minor: guardians operate the account.":"Le titulaire est mineur : les tuteurs gèrent le compte.","Joint holders own the account with the primary holder; signatories may only sign.":"Les cotitulaires détiennent le compte avec le titulaire principal ; les signataires peuvent seulement signer.","Mandate required":"Mandat requis","This account needs an approved mandate before it can be debited.":"Ce compte nécessite un mandat approuvé avant tout débit.","Signatures required":"Signatures requises","Signer":"Signataire"});
Object.assign(translations.sw,{"Customer type":"Aina ya mteja","Individual":"Mtu binafsi","Organization":"Taasisi","Registration certificate":"Cheti cha usajili","For an organization, enter the registered name, the incorporation date as date of birth, the country of registration as nationality, and the registration certificate as the document.":"Kwa taasisi, andika jina lililosajiliwa, tarehe ya kuanzishwa kama tarehe ya kuzaliwa, nchi ya usajili kama uraia, na cheti cha usajili kama hati.","Directors & owners":"Wakurugenzi na wamiliki","Person":"Mtu","Role":"Jukumu","Ownership %":"Umiliki %","None":"Hakuna","Director":"Mkurugenzi","Beneficial owner":"Mmiliki halisi","Representative":"Mwakilishi","Record every director and each beneficial owner with their ownership percentage. At least one director is required before the organization can transact. Ownership applies to beneficial owners only.":"Rekodi kila mkurugenzi na kila mmiliki halisi pamoja na asilimia ya umiliki. Angalau mkurugenzi mmoja anahitajika kabla taasisi haijafanya miamala. Umiliki unahusu wamiliki halisi pekee.","Mandate":"Mamlaka","Account mandate":"Mamlaka ya akaunti","Signing rule":"Kanuni ya kusaini","Any one signer":"Msaini mmoja yeyote","Any two signers":"Wasaini wawili wowote","All signers":"Wasaini wote","Joint holder":"Mmiliki mwenza","Authorised signatory":"Msaini aliyeidhinishwa","Guardian":"Mlezi","Holder":"Mmiliki","Current rule":"Kanuni ya sasa","No mandate recorded yet.":"Bado hakuna mamlaka yaliyorekodiwa.","Signatories must be recorded directors or representatives of the organization.":"Wasaini lazima wawe wakurugenzi au wawakilishi waliorekodiwa wa taasisi.","The account holder is a minor: guardians operate the account.":"Mmiliki wa akaunti ni mtoto: walezi ndio wanaoendesha akaunti.","Joint holders own the account with the primary holder; signatories may only sign.":"Wamiliki wenza wanamiliki akaunti pamoja na mmiliki mkuu; wasaini wanaweza kusaini tu.","Mandate required":"Mamlaka yanahitajika","This account needs an approved mandate before it can be debited.":"Akaunti hii inahitaji mamlaka yaliyoidhinishwa kabla ya kutoa pesa.","Signatures required":"Saini zinazohitajika","Signer":"Msaini"});
// Period close and signer capture. Machine-assisted wording; include in the pending language review.
Object.assign(translations.fr,{"Month-end and year-end close":"Clôture mensuelle et annuelle","Close policy":"Politique de clôture","Close the period":"Clôturer la période","Fiscal year ends in month":"L’exercice se termine au mois","Each month must be closed on its last business day before that day closes. Year-end close moves income and expenses into retained earnings.":"Chaque mois doit être clôturé lors de son dernier jour ouvré avant la clôture de ce jour. La clôture annuelle transfère produits et charges vers les résultats reportés.","No close policy yet: month-end close is not enforced.":"Aucune politique de clôture : la clôture mensuelle n’est pas imposée.","Period end":"Fin de période","Type":"Type","Year end":"Fin d’exercice","Month end":"Fin de mois","No period closes yet.":"Aucune clôture de période.","Approve a credit-normal equity ledger for retained earnings first.":"Approuvez d’abord un compte de capitaux propres créditeur pour les résultats reportés.","Fiscal year end month":"Mois de fin d’exercice","Retained earnings ledger":"Compte de résultats reportés","Choose one retained earnings ledger for each legal entity and currency that books income or expenses.":"Choisissez un compte de résultats reportés par entité juridique et devise comptabilisant des produits ou des charges.","Year-end close":"Clôture annuelle","Month-end close":"Clôture mensuelle","Approval seals this business day; no further postings are accepted for it.":"L’approbation scelle ce jour ouvré ; aucune autre écriture n’est acceptée.","Debits":"Débits","Credits":"Crédits","Income":"Produits","Expense":"Charges","Result":"Résultat","Closing journals":"Écritures de clôture","Authorising signers":"Signataires autorisant"});
Object.assign(translations.sw,{"Month-end and year-end close":"Kufunga mwezi na mwaka","Close policy":"Sera ya kufunga","Close the period":"Funga kipindi","Fiscal year ends in month":"Mwaka wa fedha unaisha mwezi","Each month must be closed on its last business day before that day closes. Year-end close moves income and expenses into retained earnings.":"Kila mwezi lazima ufungwe siku yake ya mwisho ya kazi kabla siku hiyo haijafungwa. Kufunga mwaka huhamisha mapato na matumizi kwenye faida iliyobakizwa.","No close policy yet: month-end close is not enforced.":"Hakuna sera ya kufunga bado: kufunga mwezi hakulazimishwi.","Period end":"Mwisho wa kipindi","Type":"Aina","Year end":"Mwisho wa mwaka","Month end":"Mwisho wa mwezi","No period closes yet.":"Bado hakuna kipindi kilichofungwa.","Approve a credit-normal equity ledger for retained earnings first.":"Idhinisha kwanza leja ya mtaji ya upande wa mkopo kwa faida iliyobakizwa.","Fiscal year end month":"Mwezi wa mwisho wa mwaka wa fedha","Retained earnings ledger":"Leja ya faida iliyobakizwa","Choose one retained earnings ledger for each legal entity and currency that books income or expenses.":"Chagua leja moja ya faida iliyobakizwa kwa kila taasisi na sarafu inayorekodi mapato au matumizi.","Year-end close":"Kufunga mwaka","Month-end close":"Kufunga mwezi","Approval seals this business day; no further postings are accepted for it.":"Idhini hufunga siku hii ya kazi; hakuna miamala mingine itakayokubaliwa.","Debits":"Matoleo","Credits":"Maingizo","Income":"Mapato","Expense":"Matumizi","Result":"Matokeo","Closing journals":"Maingizo ya kufunga","Authorising signers":"Wasaini wanaoidhinisha"});
