Object.assign(translations.fr,{"Management reports":"Rapports de gestion","Financial statements":"États financiers","Deposits":"Dépôts","By product":"Par produit","By branch":"Par agence","Largest depositors":"Principaux déposants","Share of deposits %":"Part des dépôts %","Loan quality":"Qualité du portefeuille de prêts","Outstanding":"Encours","Non-performing %":"Créances douteuses %","Days past due use posted repayments and accruals. Non-performing means more than 90 days past due.":"Les jours de retard reposent sur les remboursements et intérêts comptabilisés. Une créance douteuse a plus de 90 jours de retard.","Cash holdings":"Encaisses","Work waiting":"Travail en attente","Item":"Élément","Count":"Nombre","Pending approval":"Approbation en attente","Failed postings":"Écritures en échec","Alerts":"Alertes","Open compliance cases":"Dossiers de conformité ouverts","Open cash exceptions":"Écarts de caisse ouverts","Open payment cases":"Dossiers de paiement ouverts","Report definitions":"Définitions de rapports","New or change definition":"Créer ou modifier une définition","Run":"Exécuter","Balance sheet":"Bilan","Income statement":"Compte de résultat","Statement":"État","Download":"Télécharger","Nothing to show.":"Rien à afficher.","Balances as at a date":"Soldes à une date","Movements over a period":"Mouvements sur une période","Unknown chart account":"Compte inconnu","Each line is the signed sum of chart accounts; group accounts include everything beneath them. Configure official returns from their published templates.":"Chaque ligne est la somme signée de comptes ; un compte de regroupement inclut tous ses sous-comptes. Configurez les déclarations officielles à partir de leurs modèles publiés."});
Object.assign(translations.sw,{"Management reports":"Ripoti za usimamizi","Financial statements":"Taarifa za fedha","Deposits":"Amana","By product":"Kwa bidhaa","By branch":"Kwa tawi","Largest depositors":"Wawekaji wakubwa","Share of deposits %":"Sehemu ya amana %","Loan quality":"Ubora wa mikopo","Outstanding":"Inayodaiwa","Non-performing %":"Mikopo chechefu %","Days past due use posted repayments and accruals. Non-performing means more than 90 days past due.":"Siku za kuchelewa zinatumia marejesho na riba zilizorekodiwa. Mkopo chechefu umechelewa zaidi ya siku 90.","Cash holdings":"Fedha taslimu","Work waiting":"Kazi zinazosubiri","Item":"Kipengele","Count":"Idadi","Pending approval":"Idhini inayosubiri","Failed postings":"Miamala iliyoshindwa","Alerts":"Arifa","Open compliance cases":"Kesi za uzingatiaji zilizo wazi","Open cash exceptions":"Tofauti za fedha zilizo wazi","Open payment cases":"Kesi za malipo zilizo wazi","Report definitions":"Ufafanuzi wa ripoti","New or change definition":"Unda au badilisha ufafanuzi","Run":"Endesha","Balance sheet":"Mizania","Income statement":"Taarifa ya mapato","Statement":"Taarifa","Download":"Pakua","Nothing to show.":"Hakuna cha kuonyesha.","Balances as at a date":"Salio hadi tarehe","Movements over a period":"Miamala katika kipindi","Unknown chart account":"Akaunti isiyojulikana","Each line is the signed sum of chart accounts; group accounts include everything beneath them. Configure official returns from their published templates.":"Kila mstari ni jumla ya akaunti zenye ishara; akaunti za kundi zinajumuisha zote zilizo chini yake. Sanidi ripoti rasmi kutoka violezo vyake vilivyochapishwa."});
